{"id": "17-1158-2-16", "zh": "sakamandhātu 等词，在 si 之前词尾变为 u，并且删去 si；由于再次作了规定，这是必然的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1158-17-25", "zh": "这位国王的财富如同 Sakamandhātu 王一般。其余变化相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1158-26-28", "zh": "mahāmandhātu 等词也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1159-2-5", "zh": "pitu 一词的变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1159-6-15", "zh": "在 si 之前变为 ā，删去 si，成为 pitā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1160-2-14", "zh": "在 yo 之前，“āro” 与 “rassaṃ” 继续有效。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1161-2-7", "zh": "168. pitā 等词，在 si 以外。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1162-2-11", "zh": "pitā 等词的替代音 āra，在 si 以外的格尾之前变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1162-12-26", "zh": "在 si 之前本来就没有 āra 替代，却仍然说 **asimhi**，这多出来的措辞是为了表示另一层意思：由此，在 to 等之前，pitā 等词还变为 i 尾。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1162-27-40", "zh": "例如：pitito、mātito、bhātito、dhītito、pitipakkho、mātipakkho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1163-2-7", "zh": "pitaro；其余与 kattu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1163-8-26", "zh": "bho pita、bho pitā，bhavanto pitaro；pitaraṃ，pitare、pitaro；pitarā、pitunā，pitarehi、pitarebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1163-27-70", "zh": "依照以抽象名词形式所作的指示，没有 āra 替代时：pitūhi、pitūbhi、pituhi、pitubhi；pitu、pituno、pitussa；pitarānaṃ、pitānaṃ、pitūnaṃ，不变长音时也可作 pitunaṃ；pitarā，pitarehi、pitarebhi、pitūhi、pitūbhi、pituhi、pitubhi；pitu、pituno、pitussa，pitarānaṃ、pitānaṃ、pitūnaṃ、pitunaṃ；pitari，pitaresu、pitūsu、pitusu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1164-2-7", "zh": "bhātā 也是这样：bhātā、bhātaro 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1165-2-4", "zh": "以上是 u 尾词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1166-2-7", "zh": "ū 尾阳性词 abhibhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1167-2-8", "zh": "同样生起 si 等格尾，删去 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1167-9-17", "zh": "so abhibhū；删去 yo 之后，te abhibhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1168-2-13", "zh": "依照 “agho rassaṃ” 等规则变为短音，并且变为 vo。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1168-14-17", "zh": "因为已经变为短音，所以不变为 a。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-1168-18-26", "zh": "abhibhuvo，bho abhibhu，bhavanto abhibhū、abhibhuvo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1169-2-7", "zh": "因为已经变为短音，所以不替代为 ve。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1169-8-14", "zh": "其余与 bhikkhu 一词相同，区别只在于变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1169-15-31", "zh": "abhibhuṃ，abhibhū、abhibhuvo，abhibhunā，abhibhūhi、abhibhūbhi，abhibhuno、abhibhussa，abhibhūnaṃ 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1170-2-10", "zh": "sayambhū、vessabhū、parābhibhū、sahabhū 等也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1170-11-18", "zh": "sahabhū 一词的区别，只在于 yo 替代为 no。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1170-19-25", "zh": "sahabhū，sahabhū、sahabhuvo、sahabhuno 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1171-2-8", "zh": "同样，sabbaññū 一词的区别只在 yo 格尾上。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1171-9-33", "zh": "so sabbaññū、te sabbaññū；不删 yo 时变为短音，并且在 “lato vokāro ca” 这条规则中，借 kāra 一词，yo 替代为 no。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1171-34-41", "zh": "由于 vā 的管辖是有限定的任选，所以不变为 vo。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1171-42-56", "zh": "sabbaññuno，bho sabbaññu，bhonto sabbaññū、sabbaññuno，sabbaññuṃ，sabbaññū、sabbaññuno 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1172-2-16", "zh": "maggaññū、dhammaññū、atthaññū、kālaññū、rattaññū、mattaññū、kataññū、tathaññū、viññū、vidū、vedagū、pāragū 等也是这样。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1173-2-4", "zh": "以上是 ū 尾词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1174-2-5", "zh": "e 尾词并不常见。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1175-2-7", "zh": "o 尾阳性词 go。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1176-2-11", "zh": "然后生起 si 等格尾，删去 si：go gacchati（牛走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1177-2-26", "zh": "从这里到 “gāva se” 为止，“go” 是管辖项，“āva” 也继续有效。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1178-2-7", "zh": "169. 在 yo 之前也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1179-2-11", "zh": "go 的 o 在 yo 之前替代为 āva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1179-12-19", "zh": "借 ca 字，在 nā、smā、smiṃ 之前也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1179-20-34", "zh": "在 “tato yonamo tu” 这条规则中，借 tu 一词，yo 变为 o，再删去元音等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1179-35-37", "zh": "gāvo tiṭṭhanti（牛群站着）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1180-2-8", "zh": "170. 在 aṃ 之前也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1181-2-14", "zh": "go 的 o 在格尾 aṃ 之前替代为 āva、ava。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1181-15-25", "zh": "借 ca 字，在 yo、nā、sa、smā、smiṃ 之前也替代为 ava。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1181-26-36", "zh": "gavo gacchanti（牛群走），he go，he gāvo、he gavo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1182-2-10", "zh": "在第二格中，“aṃmhi” 继续有效。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1183-2-7", "zh": "171. āva 可选变为 u。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1184-2-14", "zh": "go 的替代形 āva，其词尾元音在格尾 aṃ 之前可选替代为 u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1184-15-22", "zh": "āvassa 指 āva 的 a，也就是 āva 一词词尾的 a。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1184-23-30", "zh": "依照 “aṃmo” 等规则变为鼻音 ṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1184-31-37", "zh": "gāvuṃ、gāvaṃ、gavaṃ，gāvo、gavo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1185-2-11", "zh": "“goṇa” 与 “vā” 继续有效。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1186-2-7", "zh": "172. 在 su、hi、nā 之前也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1187-2-13", "zh": "在 su、hi、nā 之前，整个 go 词可选替代为 goṇa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1187-14-18", "zh": "借 ca 字，在其余格尾之前也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1187-19-38", "zh": "goṇo，goṇā，he goṇa、he goṇā，goṇaṃ，goṇe，goṇena，goṇehi、goṇebhi，goṇassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1188-2-8", "zh": "173. 在 naṃ 之前可选变为 goṇa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1189-2-12", "zh": "整个 go 词在格尾 naṃ 之前可选替代为 goṇa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1189-13-31", "zh": "goṇānaṃ，goṇā、goṇasmā、goṇamhā，goṇehi、goṇebhi，goṇassa，goṇānaṃ，goṇe、goṇasmiṃ、goṇamhi，goṇesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1190-2-9", "zh": "不替代为 goṇa 时：gāvena、gavena，gohi、gobhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1191-2-8", "zh": "174. 在 sa 之前变为 gāva。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1192-2-11", "zh": "这条规则由 “go āva se” 三个词组成。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1192-12-23", "zh": "规则中的 go 指 go 的 o：go 一词的 o 在格尾 sa 之前替代为 āva。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1192-24-26", "zh": "gāvassa、gavassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1193-2-14", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，“go” 与 “ava” 也继续有效。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1194-2-10", "zh": "175. 其后的 naṃ 变为 aṃ；在 pati 之前以及不删格尾的复合词中也是这样。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1195-2-23", "zh": "在 go 一词之后的 naṃ 替代为 aṃ；并且在后接 pati 时以及在不删格尾的复合词中，go 的 o 替代为 ava。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1195-24-30", "zh": "借 ca 字，不在复合词中时也替代为 aṃ 和 ava。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1195-31-35", "zh": "gavaṃpatissa therassa（属于憍梵波提长老），gavaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1196-2-15", "zh": "在 “suhināsu ca” 这条规则中，借 ca 字，在 naṃ 之前替代为 gu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1196-16-31", "zh": "在 “no ca dvādito naṃmhi” 这条规则中，借 ca 字，还增加 n 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1196-32-34", "zh": "gunnaṃ，或者 gonaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1197-2-29", "zh": "gāvā、gāvamhā、gāvasmā、gavā、gavamhā、gavasmā，gohi、gobhi，gāvassa、gavassa，gavaṃ、gunnaṃ、gonaṃ，gāve、gāvamhi、gāvasmiṃ、gave、gavamhi、gavasmiṃ，gāvesu、gavesu、gosu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1198-2-4", "zh": "以上是 o 尾词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1199-2-13", "zh": "puriso、guṇavā、rājā、sā、aggi、daṇḍī 和 bhikkhu；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1200-2-10", "zh": "satthā、abhibhū、sabbaññū 以及 go——这是阳性词的总括。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1201-2-4", "zh": "阳性词完。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1202-2-31", "zh": "asmā、nasmā、tasmā、namhā、tamhā，nehi、nebhi、tehi、tebhi，assa、nassa、tassa，nesaṃ、tesaṃ、nesānaṃ、tesānaṃ，asmiṃ、nasmiṃ、tasmiṃ、namhi、tamhi，nesu、tesu。", "confidence": 85}
